==Miscellaneous==
*Platinum Ticket obtained from [[Catnip Challenges]] after beating [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legends]] 2 and 3 stars.
*[[Isle of the Map Lord]] now appears in the event calendar.
*Fixed the description of [[St. Dober]] which mistakenly stated he performed [[Savage Blow|savage blows]] instead of [[Surge Attack|surge attack]]s.
*[[Mecha-Bun (Enemy)|Mecha-Bun]]'s [[Omni Strike]] reduced from -270~270 to -300~240.
*Added [[Cat Shrine]] feature
**Exchange XP into rewards.
**Can exchange 100k, 1m, 3m or 5m XP on every use. Each can only be drawn from at most 5 times per appearance.
**Every price option has a different reward pool that isn't a direct upgrade to the previous one.
**Spend XP to level up the Shrine.
**Appears at random times and will disappear after a random amount of purchases, or instantly if it levels up to a multiple of 10.

